      "side": 1,
      "message": "This may send queries on IPv6-only networks like 464xlat networks, which may not be appropriate.\n\nBut actually haveIpv4 would return true on such networks, so we\u0027re already sending them there. Ideally for mDNS a different haveIpv4 check would be used, which checks that you can send packets to IPv4 multicast, but this is not making it worse",
